Native allocation-failure handling at the pinned Recast/Detour revision.
Implicit vector growth throws std::bad_alloc; reserve retains its bool result.
Partial elements, contours, navigation tiles and query pools remain destructible.
Invalid query reinitialization is rejected before mutating existing ownership.

